{
  "video_id": "FIGZny4b0Qk",
  "title": "I Added Google's 131 Free Skills To Claude",
  "description": "Google maintains an official Agent Skills library on GitHub at google/skills. It launched in April 2026 with 13 skills and now has 131, under Apache-2.0, with 19,495 stars.\n\nA skill is a written manual an AI agent reads when a task matches it. There are skills for deploying to Cloud Run, querying BigQuery, pulling live Google Analytics data, and 14 covering the Google Ads API including conversion loss and lost impression share diagnostics.\n\nInstall with npx skills add google/skills. Because of progressive disclosure Claude only loads the one manual it needs, so keeping all 131 costs almost nothing. Agent Skills is an open format, so the same folder works across roughly 46 other agent tools.\n\nGet the full setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12HZipsDUxzKqfoiMV6Ji8NfqOnkaFFnczAK3F6iXHj4/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #Google",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T20:06:46Z",
  "channel_name": "Sebastian Hardy | AI Marketing",
  "transcript": "Google maintains an official Agent Skills library on GitHub at google/skills. It launched in April 2026 with 13 skills and now has 131, under Apache-2.0, with 19,495 stars.\n\nA skill is a written manual an AI agent reads when a task matches it. There are skills for deploying to Cloud Run, querying BigQuery, pulling live Google Analytics data, and 14 covering the Google Ads API including conversion loss and lost impression share diagnostics.\n\nInstall with npx skills add google/skills. Because of progressive disclosure Claude only loads the one manual it needs, so keeping all 131 costs almost nothing. Agent Skills is an open format, so the same folder works across roughly 46 other agent tools.\n\nGet the full setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12HZipsDUxzKqfoiMV6Ji8NfqOnkaFFnczAK3F6iXHj4/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ClaudeAI #Google",
